@GlobeHire_HostAddress = http://localhost:5077

### Create a workforce plan
POST {{GlobeHire_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clients/client-acme/workforce-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-request-0001

{
  "roleTitle": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "countryCode": "US",
  "proposedStartDate": "2099-08-01",
  "annualCompensation": 120000,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Replay the same request: 200 with the original plan, not a duplicate
POST {{GlobeHire_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clients/client-acme/workforce-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-request-0001

{
  "roleTitle": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "countryCode": "US",
  "proposedStartDate": "2099-08-01",
  "annualCompensation": 120000,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### OpenAPI contract
GET {{GlobeHire_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
